ShopMate Ghana — password-policy correction (common password + trailing numbers, symbols, spaces or emoji), LOCAL run
Owner-approved 14 Nov 2026 after device test TC-DEV-01 step 2 (`password123` was accepted). Regex refined after two reviews: Option A (Unicode letters), then Option C (combining marks).
Fictitious values only. Generated: 2026-11-14T20:11:48Z   Base commit: 3e4b7b1 + uncommitted change
Rule: base = lower.replace(/(?:[^\p{L}\p{M}]\p{M}*)+$/u, '') — trailing non-letters removed together with any combining marks attached to them; letters of any alphabet, and marks attached to letters, kept.
